      "delta": " Native interactions: explicit on-request policy with readback, opt-in caller-owned request lifecycle, one-shot typed replies and local cancellation records; no fallback allow or persistence. Native replies await acknowledged stdin writes under bounded ownership. 0.54.3 re-vendor: take the upstream sessionCredentialRedactor in place of mcpCredentialRedactor; the approval policy option stays."
